NOTE ON DEPENDENCIES

This project's own source is MIT. The extraction engines it drives are not:

  - PyMuPDF and pymupdf4llm are AGPL-3.0 (Artifex also sells a commercial
    licence). They are imported directly and are a required dependency.
  - Marker (marker-pdf) is GPL-3.0 with an additional commercial-use
    condition from its authors. It is an optional dependency and is invoked
    as a subprocess, never imported.

If you plan to distribute a derived work, check the current terms of those
projects yourself rather than relying on this note.
